l."}, {"id": "grass", "sp": "axonopus, paspalum", "xh": 0.1}, {"id": "qualea", "sp": "qualea", "xh": 0.28}, {"id": "myrcia", "sp": "myrcia", "xh": 0.46, "name": "Myrcia shrubs", "desc": "Common fruiting shrubs and trees of the Cerrado. GloBI records link their fruit to many birds, tapirs, coatis and foxes."}, {"id": "wolfapple", "sp": "solanum lycocarpum", "xh": 0.64}, {"id": "buriti", "sp": "mauritia flexuosa", "xh": 0.82}, {"id": "termite", "sp": "isoptera", "xh": 0.1, "ic": "hopper"}, {"id": "leafcutter", "sp": "atta", "xh": 0.26}, {"id": "deer", "sp": "ozotoceros bezoarticus", "xh": 0.42}, {"id": "rhea", "sp": "rhea americana", "xh": 0.58}, {"id": "tapir", "sp": "tapirus terrestris", "xh": 0.74, "desc": "Eats fruit and leaves, and GloBI records it eating Myrcia. Buriti fruit is a food for tapirs, and the park lists tapir as present."}, {"id": "kiskadee", "sp": "pitangus sulphuratus", "xh": 0.9}, {"id": "anteater", "sp": "myrmecophaga tridactyla", "xh": 0.12, "desc": "Tears open termite and ant nests with its claws and licks up the insects. Only jaguars and pumas are known to hunt adults."}, {"id": "armadillo", "sp": "dasypus novemcinctus", "xh": 0.3, "desc": "Digs for insects such as ants and termites. It is prey for maned wolves, ocelots and big cats in GloBI records."}, {"id": "seriema", "sp": "cariama cristata", "xh": 0.48}, {"id": "manedwolf", "sp": "chrysocyon brachyurus", "xh": 0.68}, {"id": "vulture", "sp": "coragyps atratus", "xh": 0.86, "desc": "The park lists black vultures among its birds. They clean up carcasses of animals that have died."}, {"id": "jaguar", "sp": "panthera onca", "xh": 0.35, "desc": "The largest cat here. Its prey in the Cerrado includes giant anteater, tapir and deer, and it also hunts maned wolves."}, {"id": "puma", "sp": "puma concolor", "xh": 0.65, "desc": "A widespread big cat that hunts deer, rheas, armadillos and anteaters. It is a main predator of pampas deer."}], "raw": [["grass", "decomp", "d"], ["qualea", "decomp", "d"], 